马丁公司的产品，整舰基本就是围绕这部雷达展开设计，因此洛克希德·马丁公司公布的数据被认为具备相当可信度。 内容来源日本天价打造“全球最大驱逐舰”_日元_成本_美国"},"attached_info":"CkoI04XBxuO2q/06EAMaCTExNDYwNTgyMCDq85bABjAAOO4DQBByEzE4OTc2MTEwODQwNTcyNjQ5MzF4AKoBCWJpbGxib2FyZNIBAA==","detail_text":"59 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-00a8184e9529510e9ec340acd4be23b5_1440w.jpg"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"17_1745310270.145649","card_id":"Q_11335630202","target":{"id":11335630202,"title":"古装剧里有哪些被认为是古代就有的东西其实是近现代才出现的?","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/11335630202","type":"question","created":1738737024,"answer_count":27,"follower_count":67,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[284,5510,12009,24481,140022],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":""},"attached_info":"CkEI04XBxuO2q/06EAMaCTExMzI0Mjg0OCCAi4y9BjAAOENAEXILMTEzMzU2MzAyMDJ4AKoBCWJpbGxib2FyZNIBAA==","detail_text":"58 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-d9757803b915471d515ef47cd99f7980_b.jpg"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"18_1745310270.145971","card_id":"Q_7990404732","target":{"id":7990404732,"title":"从心理学角度看「人为什么喜欢猫」？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/7990404732","type":"question","created":1735270670,"answer_count":36,"follower_count":71,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[404,15317,18974,23237],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":"小的时候我特别喜欢狗，对猫就没有什么感觉，甚至认为自己一定不会喜欢它。长大之后，这种想法完全反过来了，对猫的喜爱程度直线飙升，这到底因为什么啊？ 小时候家里人问我，以后结婚有孩子了，我想要个男孩还是女孩，我说男孩。实际上我感觉狗就特别像男孩。长大后，家里人问我想要个男孩还是女孩，我说女孩。同样我感觉猫就特别像女孩。我说不上来这种感觉，但就觉得这种感觉很真实，为什么？"},"attached_info":"CkAI04XBxuO2q/06EAMaCTExMjU3NDYwMSCOwri7BjAAOEdAEnIKNzk5MDQwNDczMngAqgEJY